Title: Creep
Artist: Radiohead
Key: G major
Tempo: 94
Time: 4/4

# The whole song is one four-chord progression, two bars to a chord — 88 bars,
# eleven passes, no exceptions. Verified against the recording's own bar grid
# (bench/inspect_song.py): the cycle runs 0:00.2 → 0:20.3, which is eight bars
# at 94 bpm and not four, so a chart writing one bar per chord is at half the
# song's harmonic rhythm.
#
# Note: harmonically uniform, so where the intro ends and verse 1 begins is a
# labelling choice and nothing in the chords can settle it. The section split
# below is the published arrangement; `form` is graded on the pattern of
# contrast, which for this song is a single letter either way.

